    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点 2: 线性系统的判断",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            109,
            418,
            127
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、定义—同时满足叠加性和均匀性(齐次性)的系统称之为线性系统。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            138,
            726,
            154
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、判断方法：先线性后系统 $H\\left[a_{1}e_{1}(t) + a_{2}e_{2}(t)\\right] =$ 先系统后线性 $a_1r_1(t) + a_2r_2(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            492,
            778,
            510
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "中括号内就是激励，让其按照系统作用变化",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            327,
            519,
            672,
            534
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "table",
        "img_path": "images/c1da07e1c3f1b60cb6691116e0a96f3ede9778d1baf6173917a5ccea976c953e.jpg",
        "table_caption": [],
        "table_footnote": [],
        "table_body": "<table><tr><td>题目</td><td> $r(t) = e^{2}(t)$ </td></tr><tr><td>系统作用:让激励。。。。。。</td><td>让激励 取平方</td></tr><tr><td>先线性后系统  $H[a_{1}e_{1}(t)+a_{2}e_{2}(t)]=$ </td><td></td></tr><tr><td>先系统后线性  $a_{1}r_{1}(t)+a_{2}r_{2}(t)=$ </td><td></td></tr><tr><td>综上所述,定结论</td><td></td></tr></table>",
