        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 30: 试判断 $r(t) = \\int_{-\\infty}^{5t} e(\\tau) d\\tau$ 的线性和时不变性？",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            414,
            594,
