    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点7：可逆系统和不可逆系统",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            109,
            482,
            125
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、定义：若不同激励对应不同的响应，则为可逆系统，若对应相同响应则为不可逆系统。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            138,
            810,
            176
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例： $r(t)=\\frac{de(t)}{dt}$ 为不可逆系统",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            185,
            421,
            219
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$r(t)=e(2t)$ 为可逆系统",
        "bbox": [
            494,
            193,
            672,
            211
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、可逆系统的求解",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            250,
            344,
            264
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/331c055f6fff1739f6aeba7aff7325a24d1135bd2499835f990f4f28a1a87867.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            260,
            281,
            680,
            323
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "由系统作用可知 $r(t)=e(2t)$ 的逆系统为 $r(t)=e\\left(\\frac{t}{2}\\right)$",
        "bbox": [
            186,
            334,
            571,
            369
